      "body": "Tool recommendation\n\nName: ClearPNG\n\nWebsite: https://clearpng.shop\n\nDescription:\n\nClearPNG is an online image background remover that helps users export clean transparent PNG files.\n\nIt is mainly useful for:\n\n- removing white backgrounds from logos\n- making signature images transparent\n- removing backgrounds from product photos\n- creating transparent PNGs from everyday images\n\nThe workflow is simple: upload an image, remove the background, preview the result, and download the transparent PNG.\n\nThe site is built with Next.js and Cloudflare Pages. The current version uses the remove.bg API for background removal.\n\nScreenshot:\n\nYou can attach a screenshot of the homepage or a before/after result here.",
